iv id="agents" data-w-id="0fd6f2f4-fbc9-4cf2-42bd-e917e92f0282" class="layout516_item item-1"><div class="layout516_item-content"><div class="layout516_item-content-top"><div class="tag_wrap is-8a3fdc"><div class="text-style-tagline">Agents</div></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h2 class="heading-style-h4">Put agents to work</h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><p class="text-size-regular text-color-n400">Define your thesis, and deploy agents built to act on it.From signal to execution, with full control and visibility at every step.</p></div><div class="layout516_item-content-bottom"><div data-accordion-close-siblings="true" data-accordion-css-init="" class="accordion-css"><ul class="accordion-css__list"><li data-accordion-status="active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Turn thesis into agents</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Define your edge, and let the system turn it into a structured agent built to act on it.</p></div></div></div></li><li data-accordion-status="not-active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Test before execution</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Simulate behavior, preview actions, and validate<br/>your agent before it goes live.</p></div></div></div></li><li data-accordion-status="not-active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Continuous execution</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Agents continuously observe, evaluate, and act,<br/>responding to markets in real time.</p></div></div></div></li><li data-accordion-status="not-active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Full control &amp; transparency</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Track every action, understand every decision, and adjust behavior at any time.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="layout516_image-wrapper-mobile"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/686503d508ad0a273db78aec_arch1-bg.svg" alt="" class="layout516_image"/><div class="arch_asset-wrapper"><div class="arch_image-wrapper"><div class="header_image-stroke"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big-p-2000.webp 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big-p-2600.webp 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big.webp 2880w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a312909721ba9100d91a067_Agent-img-big.webp" loading="eager" class="arch_image-main"/></div><img class="arch_subasset is-1 hide" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a32cb129881c1bf5f789aa0_content%20(4).png" width="370" alt="" data-scroll-speed="0.05" data-scroll="" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a32cb129881c1bf5f789aa0_content%20(4)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a32cb129881c1bf5f789aa0_content%20(4).png 740w"/><div data-scroll-speed="0.05" data-scroll="" class="hero-feature is-1 is-agents"><div class="feature is-agent"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a32d43a7be73c7326a91c24_agentics-logs.png" loading="eager" width="489.5" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 489px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a32d43a7be73c7326a91c24_agentics-logs-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a32d43a7be73c7326a91c24_agentics-logs.png 708w" class="img-feature"/></div></div></div></div></div><div id="elastics-ai" data-w-id="0fd6f2f4-fbc9-4cf2-42bd-e917e92f0296" class="layout516_item item-2"><div class="layout516_item-content"><div class="layout516_item-content-top"><div class="tag_wrap is-b600"><div class="text-style-tagline">Elastics AI</div></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h2 class="heading-style-h4">Trade with words</h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><p class="text-size-regular text-color-n400">Turn ideas into trades instantly. Search, analyze, and act on opportunities using natural language.</p></div><div class="layout516_item-content-bottom"><div data-accordion-close-siblings="true" data-accordion-css-init="" class="accordion-css"><ul class="accordion-css__list"><li data-accordion-status="active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Natural language search</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Find markets and events by describing what you&#x27;re looking for, across platforms and categories.</p></div></div></div></li><li data-accordion-status="not-active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Cross-market discovery</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Discover opportunities across markets, including price differences and mispricings between platforms.</p></div></div></div></li><li data-accordion-status="not-active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Opportunity analysis</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Understand probabilities, pricing, and market dynamics instantly with AI-assisted breakdowns.</p></div></div></div></li><li data-accordion-status="not-active" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 class="accordion-css__item-h6 heading-style-h6">Instant execution</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M12.5 19.7916V12.4999M12.5 12.4999V5.20825M12.5 12.4999L5.20834 12.4999M12.5 12.4999L19.7917 12.4999" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><p class="accordion-css__item-p text-size-small text-color-n400">Execute trades the moment you spot an opportunity, directly from the AI interface.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="layout516_image-wrapper-mobile"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/686503d41be5e5d5f7688043_arch2-bg.svg" alt="" class="layout516_image"/><div class="arch_asset-wrapper"><div class="arch_image-wrapper"><div class="header_image-stroke"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a31299a49d5b0b0f364421a_Chat-ai-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a31299a49d5b0b0f364421a_Chat-ai-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a31299a49d5b0b0f364421a_Chat-ai-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68629e56973c805c224da3d7/6a31299a49d5b0b0f364421a_Chat-ai-p-